        "subject": "Milestone 7 — Episodic Memory",
        "description": {
          "format": "markdown",
          "raw": "Record what a session did, locally, between reading the tracker at the start and writing to it at the end.\n\n**Implement:** a session id; working session state; checkpoints; one activity log per substantive session; and an idempotent wrap.\n\n**Tests:** no transcript is required; repeated checkpoints update the same session log; a checkpoint written by one client is readable by another.",
          "html": "<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Record what a session did, locally, between reading the tracker at the start and writing to it at the end.</p>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\"><strong>Implement:</strong> a session id; working session state; checkpoints; one activity log per substantive session; and an idempotent wrap.</p>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\"><strong>Tests:</strong> no transcript is required; repeated checkpoints update the same session log; a checkpoint written by one client is readable by another.</p>"
        },
